Z||000000||PBJ||05-06-2001||05:26 PM||||Would there be any interested Fiero owners in and around the area of Grand Bend Ontario that would like to get together informally to meet, chat and cruise???  I know that we have been to an informal meet there on Sundays at 1:00pm at "Best Icecream".  If there is interest, we will post an exact address of the location for those who are not familiar with Grand Bend and plan a date.||||reg||10
