Z||000006||PBJ||05-09-2001||09:51 PM||||Grand Bend is on Lake Huron - between Sarnia and Goderich.  It's an hour from London and a busy place on the weekends.  It has good a beach cruise strip that takes you down by the beach.  Sorta a small Canada version of Datona Beach!  Everyone with fancy wheels goes there on the weekends.  It's easy to get to.  Maybe we could set up a meet point in London and anyone who wants to join the cruise can follow. . .As far as a date, whatever is good for everyone.  Just let us know.<p>[This message has been edited by PBJ (edited 05-09-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||DaRkLoRD||05-10-2001||12:33 AM||||Grand Bend is easy to find from where I live.. just head south on hwy 9 and keep going..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>that reminds me, I should change my profile.. I don't live in Toronto anymore.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||6
Z||000008||PBJ||05-10-2001||10:22 PM||||That's good!  Now we should plan a date to get us together. . .Any suggestions???||||reg||4
Z||000009||DaRkLoRD||05-11-2001||12:40 AM||||I suggest sometime near the end of the month, a fiero friend of mine is getting his GT ready for the summer and hopefully it'll be done by then. I just told him about this upcoming meet, hopefully he'll post here soon about it. (he's a forum member)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000010||PBJ||05-12-2001||09:22 PM||||Why don't we plan for Saturday June 2 or Sunday June 3 to get together with our cars in Grand Bend.  My wife and I will be there with our two Fieros so just let us know if you want to join us.<p>[This message has been edited by PBJ (edited 05-12-2001).]||||reg||4
