Z||000019||PBJ||05-14-2001||07:50 PM||||My wife and I both have '86 GT's so you are welcome to come and check them out!!!  Hopefully there will be more of us there to check out. . .The Location depends on which way you're coming into Grand Bend.  If you're at the main stop light like your're going to head straight down towards the lake, turn left at the light and Best Icecream will be on the right a few kms down.  You'll think you're heading out of Grand Bend but it's there. The address is 345 Ontario St. (which is also Hwy 21)<p>[This message has been edited by PBJ (edited 05-14-2001).]||||reg||1
